"Casimir will not ride against the runaways; he fears losing men the Sheem would not replace."
"Casimir has leave from Prince Tavaris to pardon deserters who serve Asmirel, and has used none."
"Casimir skims a tenth of the hill tax before it goes to Qasirel, and keeps two sets of tallies."
"Casimir knows a Sheem hawk lodges above Imra's cloth hall and dares not have him touched."
